      "BIANCA: Now you have to cut it.\nBIANCA: I’m sorry but you do. You shouldn’t give her gum, mama, even in the car.\nMARTHA: No no no no mama no no.\nBIANCA: Yes, mama she does have to cut it now or the whole head will get sticky.",
